 ['Martinet1971 PropositionsIII.1-III.2 pp404-405, TheoremIV.1 p406, Example3 p407, DOI10.24033/asens.1216 https://jamartin.perso.math.cnrs.fr/AlgNT/AnnENS1971.pdf','Frohlich1974 Theorem1 p82, DOI10.24033/msmf.132 https://www.numdam.org/article/MSMF_1974__37__81_0.pdf','Prior MT-ART10 supplies central existence as background; new conclusion concerns shifted branches.','Exact finite Hurwitz formula and saved Arb70-digit certificate'],
